"'%(register)s'. In this department the book has one keeper; ask them to "
"register the entry, or have the legal manager add you to the group."
msgstr ""
"لا يمنح رقماً في السجل '%(register)s' إلا عضو في '%(group)s'. في هذه الدائرة"
